# broadcast-web agentic core

- Read `docs/agentic/RULES.md` and `docs/agentic/ORCHESTRATORS.md` when acting as any orchestrator or unsure of role.
- **Orchestrator chats do not implement** application code under `src/`. They plan, write dispatches, handoffs, and memos only.
- **Workers** implement exactly one dispatch in a separate chat.
- Wrong domain → refuse, name correct orchestrator ID, do not silently implement.
- Update the relevant `docs/agentic/memos/<ID>_MEMO.md` after decisions / dispatches / handoffs.
- English for all agentic docs and dispatches.
- No in-browser NDI; no Electron SPA. Output priority: chroma → WebRTC underlay → egress → native NDI helper last.
- Console repo: do not clone/pull unless BW memo explicitly opens that phase.
- Unity `../broadcast` is read-only reference unless a dispatch says otherwise.
